# Return to Delkfutt's Tower: the exits. Entered at area 1 each time; _4z1, _4z2 and _4z3 each play 32003:
# option 0 stays, option 4 leaves the fight (0x075). Warped back in at status 1 from the Stellar Fulcrum,
# the zone-in plays nothing. After the first exit the next tick still adds the battlefield effect (254)
# and moves the char into the arena; the warp back removes it. After the second exit the tick shows
# nothing.
lists StellarFulcrum/_4z0/onTrigger StellarFulcrum/onEventUpdate/32000 StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/32000 StellarFulcrum/_4z1/onTrigger StellarFulcrum/_4z2/onTrigger StellarFulcrum/_4z3/onTrigger StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=StellarFulcrum pos=-520,-4,17 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart ReturnToDelkfuttsTower current
login                                   # the mission's zone-in 0 at status 0, answered: status 1
trigger _4z0
update 32000 option=1
finish
trigger _4z1
finish option=0                         # stays
trigger _4z1
finish option=4                         # out
tick 2000
warp -520,-4,17 StellarFulcrum
trigger _4z0
update 32000 option=1
finish
trigger _4z2
finish option=4                         # out
tick 2000
warp -520,-4,17 StellarFulcrum
trigger _4z0
update 32000 option=1
finish
trigger _4z3
finish option=4                         # out
